## The Principal Developer Pipeline

Every task MUST progress through the following lifecycle:

```text
ANALYZE -> CHALLENGE -> DESIGN -> IMPLEMENT -> VERIFY -> REVIEW -> RELEASE
```

Never output raw code directly. First, analyze constraints, challenge weak assumptions, propose lightweight API/Websocket contracts, get user approval, write optimized async C# code, write xUnit tests, and critically self-review performance, security, and realtime latency.
